{
  "_readme": [
    "Proper-noun registry for the course translation pipeline.",
    "",
    "'never_translate' lists names that must be carried over unchanged into every",
    "language. Machine translation reads them as common nouns and mangles them:",
    "Degas became 'Entgasen' in German, Corneille became 'Varju' in Hungarian.",
    "",
    "'per_language' holds the cases where a target language does have its own",
    "established form, keyed by language code. A name absent from a language's",
    "table falls back to 'never_translate' behaviour, i.e. it is left alone.",
    "",
    "Add a name here the first time it is wrong, never twice."
  ],
